This image compiles the unmodified MinIO server from the exact official release
identified in source.json. MinIO is licensed under GNU AGPL version 3 or later;
the original LICENSE and CREDITS are preserved in upstream/ and in the image.
The exact corresponding upstream source archive is included in the image at
/usr/share/minio/source.tar.gz, together with source.json and the upstream Go
module locks. The image is a Persistent Memory build, not an upstream binary.

The separate pm-minio-health program is repository code under the MIT license
in health/LICENSE. The Go compiler/standard-library license is also included
in the image. No MinIO subscription, credentials, or license acceptance is part
of building this image.
